(ii) Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of mandamus commanding the respondent nos. 1 to 3 to desist from the interfering in the peaceful possession of the petitioner over the land in question and respondent nos. 1 to 3 be further directed to restrain respondent no. 4 from interfering in the peaceful possession of the petitioner over the land in question;
